WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.430
- With animation, I know that you don't,

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:03.410
'cause I've done animation as well,

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:06.290
so you don't get to actually
see the costars a lot of times,

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:08.700
but how cool was it to
work with Dwayne Johnson?

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.110
Like, y'all saw each
other a bit, obviously,

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.400
so how cool was that?

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.540
- Yeah, it was wonderful.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.620
I actually met him after the
recording was all finished.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.330
We met at a press junket,

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:22.060
and I was finally able to
put the voice to the face.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:26.660
And he's massive, and
plays this amazing Maui,

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.520
who's a bigger than
life character, so well.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:32.870
He's kind, he gives great
hugs, he smells good.

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:36.030
My mom has a joke that
when she first met him,

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:39.210
she went rock climbing,
so there's also that.

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:40.240
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.073
All around.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.480
- Oh my god, I love your mom. (laughing)

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:45.577
- It was an experience.

00:00:45.577 --> 00:00:47.053
- [Kelly] That's a great joke.

